- enc45.rs: typed BabyBear layouts of the frame record (13 lanes, 52
  words) and task record (7 lanes, 19 words), StackStep, StackCells,
  EMPTY_F/EMPTY_T and the H_chain spill digest (ENC-4); the five plan
  part word lists and plan_d = P2(DOM_PLAN, 1, itab_d, menu_d,
  policy_d, layout_rule_d, place_d) (ENC-5), part tags 58 to 62 (LEAD).
- tests/t9_enc45.rs: 48 pinned vectors and the ENC-4 and ENC-5
  refusals; every P2 computed on three paths.
- examples/sherlock_plan.rs: the sherlock plan tool over plan.json.
